 -------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 
 This is a log of changes that ncurses has gone through since Zeyd started
@@ -46,6 +46,13 @@
 Changes through 1.9.9e did not credit all contributions;
 it is not possible to add this information.
 
+20260307
+	+ add tic checks for pairs of user-caps strings which are listed in
+	  Caps-ncurses.
+	+ fix a few gcc warnings.
+	+ fix inconsistent checks for expanding special characters with infocmp
+	  -L option (report by Stephane Chazelas).
+
 20260301
 	+ modify mouse parsing to handle events with no delay between button
 	  press and release (report by Vincent Lefevre).
@@ -2165,7 +2172,7 @@
 	> additional changes for building with Visual Studio C++ and msys2
 	  (patches by "Maarten Anonymous"):
 	+ adjust headers/declarations to provide for "dllimport" vs "dllexport"
-	  declarations when constructing DLLs, to worko with Visual Studio C++.
+	  declarations when constructing DLLs, to work with Visual Studio C++.
 
 20200627
 	+ build-fixes for gnat 10.1.1, whose gnatmake drops integration with
